"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5171270","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4662140-1847286114040605","game_id":"steam-4662140","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix 0.8.4.2 - Fixing broken experimental level, other small fixes","summary":"Patch 0.8.4.2 - October 24th, 2026Super small hotfix patch, mostly to address an issue with the 'Glitch Portals' experimental candy level.Thank you to @sloaneliest from our Discord for reporting this issue! ChangelogFixed a bug causing the echo in Glitch Portals to be unplaceable / buggedUntrivialized the solution to 'no way out' in the first world - Cozy BeginningsUpdated the Corrupted Window hand attack animationFixed some visual foreground issues with nightmare levels","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T20:23:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040605","verified_at":"2026-10-24T22:36:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4662140-1847286114026991","game_id":"steam-4662140","kind":"update","title":"Small Patch 0.8.4.1 - New nightmare levels, bug fixes","summary":"Patch 0.8.4.1 - October 20th, 2026Small patch today addressing some issues from the previous patch + some feedback from our discord. Thank you to everyone who has been playing our NextFest demo and giving great feedback in the community! It's truly appreciated. ChangelogAdded new nightmare levels Sacrifice, No Way Out, Sour, Oddities, and LostAdded a short cooldown to using the Sparking WandFixed a bug where a lamp was shown as interactable incorrectly in an early levelFixed lighting issues acro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:23:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114026991","verified_at":"2026-10-21T06:45:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4662140-1846651706687816","game_id":"steam-4662140","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.8.4.0 - Corrupted Echoes, New levels for Confrontation","summary":"Patch 0.8.4.0 - October 18th, 2026Another big patch, this one just in time for NextFest! Thank you to everyone in our community / discord that's been sending us helpful feedback and bug reports. If you'd like to support us, spread the word that Goodnight, B will be participating in Steam's NextFest from Oct 19th - 26th.As always, feel free to ping us on our Discord Channel or leave feedback on our feedback form!Major ChangesAdded new echo type - Corrupted EchoesAdded new mechanic - Sparking Wand","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:20:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687816","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4662140-1846018067935123","game_id":"steam-4662140","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.8.3.0 - Skippable cutscenes, updated levels, new characters and more!","summary":"Patch 0.8.3.0 - October 9, 2026Goodnight, B now provides more QoL tools, updated level visuals and designs, more collectables, more characters, and best of all, SKIPPABLE CUTSCENES!Major ChangesGoodnight, B now features skippable cutscenes, allowing puzzle-focused players to jump straight to the levels.Collectible records are now collected at the phonograph instead of the fridge.Added additional collectible records throughout existing levels.Major visual and design updates to levels in the \"Tedd","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T01:37:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935123","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4662140-1844751498219794","game_id":"steam-4662140","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.8.2.0 - Steam Deck support, More native controller support, and more","summary":"Patch 0.8.2.0 - September 23, 2026A small patch is now live to address some UX issues, add Linux + SteamOS support (game should now be playable on Steam Deck!) and address some other issues!Major ChangesGoodnight, B now has a Linux + SteamOS export; The game should now be playable for SteamDeck / Linux users!The game now supports Steam Cloud!UX / ControllerDecreased the movement threshold for 'waking up' the mouse - there should no longer be any mouse input issues when placing down echoes.Added ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T23:07:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4662140-1843481262703276","game_id":"steam-4662140","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix v.0.8.1.2 - UI and Controller Support","summary":"Hotfix v.0.8.1.2 - September 14, 2026A quick hotfix is now live to address issues affecting players using controllers. UI and ControllerEnable controller support for \"End Demo\" card at the end of the demo. Fixed mouse cursor remaining visible in the pause menu or while toggling the selector with a controller.LevelFixed incorrect spelling of a level from \"Sparking Wand\" to \"Sparkling Wand.\"⚠️ Important Note: Players will need to replay level \"Confrontation: Sparkling Wand\" to mark level as comple","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T01:03:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262703276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4662140-1843481262702760","game_id":"steam-4662140","kind":"announcement","title":"Goodnight, B's Demo Releases Today! September 14","summary":"Goodnight, B's Demo is finally here!Thank you so much for everyone's support! We've reached a total of 150 wishlists and that is an awesome milestone! We were only able to make the game as good as it is because of you!Here's a list of changes that we've made since the playtest:The entire first act of the game is complete and available to play!Full Controller Support100+ new lines of Dialogue, New Characters, and lots of Story to discoverRevamped Visuals, Hub Area, and every existing level in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T19:06:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702760","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4662140-1839676055886519","game_id":"steam-4662140","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtesting is now Open!","summary":"We're excited to announce that playtesting for Goodnight, B has officially started! For those interested, you can join using the “Join Playtest” button on our Steam page, and you will automatically be admitted into the playtest.If you have any feedback or comments, feel free to join our Discord server or fill out our feedback form. We're so excited to see what you guys think of Goodnight, B!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T22:14:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886519","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4662140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:33Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:32Z","error